iles (object files, makefiles, etc.) here, keeping the source tree clean.\n*   **`-G Ninja`**: Sets the build backend to **Ninja**. Ninja is generally faster than Make for large C++ projects like llama.cpp.\n\n### 3. Build Type & Installation Paths\n```bash\n    -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \\\n    -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX"}